(text "UART8 PE1TX/PE0RX; RUN PC5; MOTOR_OK PB2.\nRUN HIGH only permits an independent lower hardware gate.\nMOTOR_OK HIGH=healthy; LOW/open/unpowered=unsafe.\nU10 protects received UART/OK when host rail is off.\nLower board needs mirrored receivers, RUN pull-down,\nVM/reset/3V3 interlocks and command-age/watchdog timeout." (at 200 188 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid f150c490-f315-46bb-b3f6-47c9f7b0063d))
(text "Flight targets leaveRUN LOW. Custom gimbal protocol is not supplied\nby compiling Betaflight/Rotorflight/INAV/ArduPilot.\nCRC/sequence/age/arm state and deliberate re-arm mandatory.\nOld motor board stays paused and is not directly compatible." (at 200 237 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid c0c159b7-f78e-4ef8-b28c-5cb719815f6d))
